{
  "declaredLength": 10280,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopa ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006F007000610020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’as-tu donc, Hoopa ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>C’est la Sacoche que porte <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\nqui te préoccupe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Est-ce ce sachet de bonbons qui a attiré\nton attention ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002E002E002E0020004500730074002D00630065002000630065002000730061006300680065007400200064006500200062006F006E0062006F006E007300200071007500690020006100200061007400740069007200E9000A0074006F006E00200061007400740065006E00740069006F006E0020003F00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce sont des Bonbons Zap-Zap.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500200073006F006E0074002000640065007300200042006F006E0062006F006E00730020005A00610070002D005A00610070002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu en veux ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200065006E002000760065007500780020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’en ai entendu parler...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa perspective de sentir des pétillements dans\nma bouche ne m’attire pas follement...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais peut-être devrais-je oublier mes préjugés.\nJe vais en goûter un !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006F007900610062006C00650020002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai entrevu une recette inédite pour\nun nouveau Donut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200065006E0074007200650076007500200075006E00650020007200650063006500740074006500200069006E00E9006400690074006500200070006F00750072000A0075006E0020006E006F0075007600650061007500200044006F006E007500740020002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une petite seconde, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006500200070006500740069007400650020007300650063006F006E00640065002C00200010000201000000002E002E002E00100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà ! J’ai ajouté une nouvelle recette !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0069006C00E0002000210020004A20190061006900200061006A006F0075007400E900200075006E00650020006E006F007500760065006C006C0065002000720065006300650074007400650020002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour préparer ce Donut, il faut que l’intensité des\nsaveurs atteigne les seuils minimaux suivants :<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSucré : 40 points ; Épicé : 200 points.\nAcide : 400 points ; Amer : 280 points.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEt enfin, Frais : 40 points.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 219
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Préviens-moi quand tu voudras que je prépare\nce nouveau Donut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007200E9007600690065006E0073002D006D006F00690020007100750061006E006400200074007500200076006F0075006400720061007300200071007500650020006A006500200070007200E90070006100720065000A006300650020006E006F0075007600650061007500200044006F006E007500740020002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Donut est aussi électrisant que le Bonbon\nZap-Zap ! Je l’ai nommé le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Plasma-Beigne<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me demande quelle partie d’Extra Illumis\nHoopa va découvrir après l’avoir mangé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a urgence !\nRejoins-moi vite sur le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Parvis d’Illumis Sud <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non, encore un incident... Mais grâce à toi,\nje suis sûre que le problème sera vite résolu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regarde.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500670061007200640065002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis sûre que même toi, tu n’as jamais vu\nde faille comme celle-ci, pas vrai ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je confirme.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200063006F006E006600690072006D0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elle est jaune...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C006C006500200065007300740020006A00610075006E0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si je t’ai appelé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, c’est pour m’aider à identifier\nquel Pokémon se trouve de l’autre côté.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, j’te dérange pas ?\nJ’ai une mission pour toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C0020006A2019007400650020006400E900720061006E0067006500200070006100730020003F000A004A20190061006900200075006E00650020006D0069007300730069006F006E00200070006F0075007200200074006F00690020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a détecté une faille plus cheloue qu’les autres !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY a sans doute un Pokémon dangereux de l’aut’\ncôté. Et s’il subit une Méga-Évolution Ferox,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nça va pas être joli !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vas avoir besoin de tes potes ! J’préviens\nt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁaon chef<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ<U+0002>fe et Miss Méga-Gemmes !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, et avant que j’oublie...\nLa faille est sur le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Parvis d’Illumis Sud<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’y suis déjà.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190079002000730075006900730020006400E9006A00E0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai déjà trouvé la faille.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006400E9006A00E0002000740072006F0075007600E90020006C00610020006600610069006C006C0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ha ! T’es toujours aussi efficace !\nSur ce, j’compte sur toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061002000680061002000210020005420190065007300200074006F0075006A006F00750072007300200061007500730073006900200065006600660069006300610063006500200021000A005300750072002000630065002C0020006A20190063006F006D007000740065002000730075007200200074006F00690020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus j’y pense, plus je me dis que Corvault ferait\nun bon maire pour la ville. Tu ne trouves pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "JE SUIS LÀ !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0045002000530055004900530020004C00C00020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mauvaise nouvelle : <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> va pas\npouvoir nous rejoindre tout de suite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610075007600610069007300650020006E006F007500760065006C006C00650020003A002000100002018B00010020007600610020007000610073000A0070006F00750076006F006900720020006E006F00750073002000720065006A006F0069006E00640072006500200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On essaie en duo, toi et moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E002000650073007300610069006500200065006E002000640075006F002C00200074006F00690020006500740020006D006F00690020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cornélia... Je peux l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāae remplacer si tu veux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0072006E00E9006C00690061002E002E002E0020004A0065002000700065007500780020006C00100003110000FF010100610065002000720065006D0070006C0061006300650072002000730069002000740075002000760065007500780020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Tu es... Millie, c’est ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200021002000540075002000650073002E002E002E0020004D0069006C006C00690065002C002000632019006500730074002000E700610020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ravie de te revoir. On s’était croisées pendant\nl’Opération Méga-Donut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, c’est vrai ! Toi aussi, t’es plutôt douée avec\nla Méga-Évolution, il me semble.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans ce cas, c’est parfait ! Notre nouveau trio est\nprêt à partir au combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\nviens me voir pour traverser la faille.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On y va ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E002000790020007600610020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, allons à Extra Illumis !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C00200061006C006C006F006E0073002000E000200045007800740072006100200049006C006C0075006D00690073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je dois encore me préparer.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200064006F0069007300200065006E0063006F007200650020006D006500200070007200E900700061007200650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’comprends ! Comme le trio a changé,\nil vaut mieux tout vérifier !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190063006F006D007000720065006E006400730020002100200043006F006D006D00650020006C00650020007400720069006F002000610020006300680061006E006700E9002C000A0069006C002000760061007500740020006D006900650075007800200074006F007500740020007600E90072006900660069006500720020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis prête quand tu veux !\nJe ne reculerai devant rien pour protéger Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, il va falloir que\ntu captures ce Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFais de ta place dans tes Boîtes.\nTu ne peux rien me cacher, je suis une pro !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon petit doigt me dit que nous avons besoin\nd’un Donut particulier pour traverser cette faille !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZERAORA ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A004500520041004F005200410020003F002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est le plus puissant des Pokémon Électrik...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ose pas imaginer ce que la Méga-Évolution\nFerox pourrait provoquer chez lui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est assez dangereux pour effrayer\nune Dresseuse telle que toi, Cornélia ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 7220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ha ! Tu rigoles ou quoi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061002000680061002000210020005400750020007200690067006F006C006500730020006F0075002000710075006F00690020003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai trop hâte de l’affronter ! C’est une CHANCE\nde se mesurer à un ennemi de ce calibre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais bien sûr, j’oublie pas qu’on doit l’apaiser\npour le sauver de la Méga-Évolution Ferox !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La concentration de Méga-Force augmente\nfortement autour de vous !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAttention ! Le spécimen est sur le point d’évoluer\nen Pokémon Méga-Ferox !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZERAAA !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 8144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0045005200410041004100200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vite, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, capture-le !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 8168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900740065002C00200010000201000000002C00200063006100700074007500720065002D006C00650020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien, ce Zeraora... Il a pas volé sa réputation !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 8228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680020006200690065006E002C0020006300650020005A006500720061006F00720061002E002E002E00200049006C00200061002000700061007300200076006F006C00E90020007300610020007200E9007000750074006100740069006F006E0020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il apparaît parfois en ville, comme s’il était en\nquête d’adversaires à affronter.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nIl lui arrive même de servir de garde du corps.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 8344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être que son désir de puissance a donné\nnaissance à sa version d’Extra Illumis ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 8620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est possible... En tout cas, il est temps pour\nnous de rentrer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006F0073007300690062006C0065002E002E002E00200045006E00200074006F007500740020006300610073002C00200069006C0020006500730074002000740065006D0070007300200070006F00750072000A006E006F00750073002000640065002000720065006E0074007200650072002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿A",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends mieux maintenant les dangers que\nvous avez dû affronter pour protéger Illumis...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez vraiment accompli des miracles !\nComment vous remercier ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 9148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200076007200610069006D0065006E00740020006100630063006F006D0070006C006900200064006500730020006D0069007200610063006C0065007300200021000A0043006F006D006D0065006E007400200076006F00750073002000720065006D0065007200630069006500720020003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est plutôt à nous de te remercier !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSans ton aide, on aurait jamais réussi à apaiser\nZeraora !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 9292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis là !\nDésolé du retard !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 9500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000730075006900730020006C00E000200021000A004400E90073006F006C00E900200064007500200072006500740061007200640020002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis là !\nDésolée du retard !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 9572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002000730075006900730020006C00E000200021000A004400E90073006F006C00E9006500200064007500200072006500740061007200640020002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’arrives trop tard ! On a déjà fini !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 9648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190061007200720069007600650073002000740072006F007000200074006100720064002000210020004F006E002000610020006400E9006A00E0002000660069006E00690020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sérieux ?\nEt Millie, qu’est-ce que tu fais là ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 9736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300E9007200690065007500780020003F000A004500740020004D0069006C006C00690065002C0020007100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000740075002000660061006900730020006C00E00020003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sérieux ?\nEt Millie, qu’est-ce que tu fais là ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 9840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300E9007200690065007500780020003F000A004500740020004D0069006C006C00690065002C0020007100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000740075002000660061006900730020006C00E00020003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai fait de mon mieux pour te remplacer, tiens !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 9944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069002000660061006900740020006400650020006D006F006E0020006D006900650075007800200070006F00750072002000740065002000720065006D0070006C0061006300650072002C0020007400690065006E00730020002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as devant toi le nouveau meilleur trio d’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 10052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190061007300200064006500760061006E007400200074006F00690020006C00650020006E006F007500760065006100750020006D00650069006C006C0065007500720020007400720069006F0020006420190049006C006C0075006D006900730020002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’EST PAS POSSIBLE !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 10168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019004500530054002000500041005300200050004F0053005300490042004C0045002000210021002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’EST PAS POSSIBLE !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
